<title>BELGIUM: ActivCard closes above Easdaq list price.</title>
<headline>ActivCard closes above Easdaq list price.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French &quot;smart card&quot; maker ActivCard ended their first day on Europe's new growth stocks market Easdaq with a mid-close level of $8.30, above the initial public offer price of $8.00.</p>
<p>The stock touched a session high of $8.50 and the last trade shown was $8.25. A volume of over 42,600 shares had been traded.</p>
<p>The shares' eight dollar final offer price was set last week at a discount to the $10-$12 orginally put forward because of the poor market climate in equity markets generally at the time.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
